        <mxCell id="note1" value="Observer (02) via publish–subscribe: enrolment code only publishes events — it never references recipients. The Notification Service reacts asynchronously; AdvisorObserver (critical-course drop) and AdminErrorObserver (system errors) subscribe identically and are added without changing enrolment logic." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;darkOpacity=0.05;fillColor=#FFF9B2;strokeColor=#B09500;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
